\q2 \rb and make|שִׂ֣ים\rb* \rb your nest|קִנֶּ֑ךָ\rb* \rb among|בֵּ֥ין\rb* \rb the stars|כּֽוֹכָבִ֖ים\rb*,
\q2 \rb even from there|מִשָּׁ֥ם\rb* \rb I will bring you down|אוֹרִֽידְךָ֖\rb*,”
